Every standard tensor-network topology (MPS, PEPS, TTN, MERA, MPO) produced \
by RandomTensorNetwork is already binary. Start from an MPS of length 4:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->100100010,ExpressionUUID->"ee100002-0001-0001-0001-000000000001"],

