  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleSubsection",
 CellID->200000020,ExpressionUUID->"ee200002-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-000000000001"],

Cell["\<\
Every standard tensor-network topology produced by RandomTensorNetwork is \
already binary, so BinaryTensorNetwork is a no-op on MPS, PEPS, and TTN \
inputs:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->200000021,ExpressionUUID->"ee200002-0001-0001-0001-000000000001"],

