Cell["\<\
The binary network's hyperedge list exposes the new spider vertex; the bonds \
attaching it to the original tensors carry tagged copies (1->i, 2->i, ...) of \
the original hyperedge index:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->300000011,ExpressionUUID->"ee300002-0001-0001-0001-000000000001"],

